{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18803","headline":"白太守行 · 刘禹锡","name":"白太守行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻有白太守，抛官归旧谿。\n苏州十万户，尽作婴儿啼。\n太守驻行舟，阊门草萋萋。\n挥袂谢啼者，依然两眉低。\n朱户非不崇，我心如重狴。\n华池非不清，意在寥廓栖。\n夸者窃所怪，贤者默思齐。\n我爲太守行，题在隐起珪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18803.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18803","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}